@0    = ~...by the gods. You weren't kidding when you said you weren't sure what was going to happen, were you? Are you all right?~
@1    = ~I'm fine, Faren. It seems our adventures aren't quite over yet.~
@2    = ~This is part of my father's realm. I wanted you here with me.~
@3    = ~I'm all right, but I don't want to hear you complaining.~
@4    = ~You've got that part right. Well, we should be off - I'm not letting you out of my sight again. Not to mention that it'll probably be better than that tree-city!~
@5    = ~Yes, let's head out.~
@6    = ~Listen, I'd prefer that you stay here for the moment.~
@7    = ~I see. Well, let's go. I guess it'll be better than that tree-city, anyway.~
@8    = ~Yes, let's go.~
@9    = ~Hey, I wasn't--~
@10   = ~Okay. I'll try not to complain...but let's head out. I don't want to let you out of my sight again - what if something happens to you?~
@11   = ~Yes, you're right - let's get moving.~
@12   = ~As long as we're out of here sharpish, I'll be happy.~
@13   = ~What? Are you sure? I...guess I'll stay, then, but I'd rather be with you.~
@14   = ~Come on, I'm sure you've got enough cash to--~
@15   = ~You?! I never thought I'd see you again after...after... Now, that's weird, I can't seem to remember properly. What the hell happened?~
@16   = ~Come on, Faren. It seems our adventures aren't quite over yet.~
@17   = ~This is part of my father's realm, although I'm not entirely sure why I'm here.~
@18   = ~I need you to join me, but I'm not having any backtalk from you.~
@19   = ~Okay. I guess anything's better than hanging around here. By Waukeen, <CHARNAME>, you couldn't have chosen a nastier place, could you?~
@20   = ~...Right. That makes two of us.~
@21   = ~I'd like you to join me again, Faren. I have the feeling I'll need you.~
@22   = ~Wait here for me, Faren. I'll let you know if I need you.~
@23   = ~Charming as always, aren't you? Fine, I'll join you, but I'm not being bossed around.~
@24   = ~Oh. There wouldn't be any chance of you sending me back to where I was, would there? No, thought not. Oh, well.~
@25   = ~So, what's it to be? Doing stuff, or waiting around here?~
@26   = ~Come on, then, Faren. I'd like you to join me.~
@27   = ~Waiting around here, I'm afraid. I'll see you soon, maybe.~
@28   = ~Okay, though it's not exactly the nicest place to hang around.~
@29   = ~Bring me Faren, the human fighter/thief.~
@30   = ~Bring me my lover, Faren Blacknall.~
